e"],"、",["CODE",{},"minutes"]," 是父组件提供的 ",["STRONG",{},"props"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"pronunciation-button","data-pronunciation-term":"props","data-pronunciation-src":"/pronunciation/b04/b264807709578e5c.wav","aria-label":"播放“props”的美式发音","title":"播放“props”的美式发音"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true"},"🔊"]],"；大括号中的表达式在本次组件调用时求值。组件名首字母大写，让 JSX 能区分 ",["CODE",{},"LessonCard"]," 与原生 ",["CODE",{},"article"],"。"],"\n",["P",{},["STRONG",{},"JSX"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"pronunciation-button","data-pronunciation-term":"JSX","data-pronunciation-src":"/pronunciation/b04/1a57a919dcf6659f.wav","aria-label":"播放“JSX”的美式发音","title":"播放“JSX”的美式发音"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true"},"🔊"]]," 是描述界面的语法，需要转换后才能执行。它生成 React 元素描述，不是已经插入页面的 DOM。返回 ",["CODE",{},"<LessonCard />"]," 是把组件交给 React 安排调用，也不等同于业务代码随意执行 ",["CODE",{},"LessonCard(...)"],"。"],"\n",["P",{},["CODE",{},"props"]," 是只读输入。一个值如果由父层拥有，本组件应通过回调请求父层修改，而不是直接改 props。真正需要随交互记住的信息，才放进 ",["STRONG",{},"state"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"pronunciation-button","data-pronunciation-term":"state","data-pronunciation-src":"/pronunciation/b04/4ba69735ca53765e.wav","aria-label":"播放“state”的美式发音","title":"播放“state”的美式发音"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true"},"🔊"]],"。比如“搜索词”需要记住，“搜索后的数量”则可以由数据和搜索词算出来。"],"\n",["H3",{"id":"一次更新分成触发计算和提交"},"一次更新分成触发计算和提交"],"\n",["P",{},"以下顺序有助于区分“函数执行了”与“屏幕改变了”："],"\n",["DIV",{"class":"code-block","data-language":"text"},["DIV",{"class":"code-block__bar"},["SPAN",{},"text"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"code-copy"},"复制代码"]],["PRE",{"class":"hljs"},["CODE",{},"用户点击 → setter 请求更新\n        → React 调用组件，计算下一份 UI 描述（render）\n        → React 把需要的变化应用到 DOM（commit）\n        → 浏览器安排样式、布局与绘制\n"]],"\n"],["P",{},["STRONG",{},"render"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"pronunciation-button","data-pronunciation-term":"render","data-pronunciation-src":"/pronunciation/b04/887270d0cbc560af.wav","aria-label":"播放“render”的美式发音","title":"播放“render”的美式发音"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true"},"🔊"]]," 在这里指 React 计算界面， ",["STRONG",{},"commit"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"pronunciation-button","data-pronunciation-term":"commit","data-pronunciation-src":"/pronunciation/b04/9505cacb7c710ed1.wav","aria-label":"播放“commit”的美式发音","title":"播放“commit”的美式发音"},["SPAN",{"aria-hidden":"true"},"🔊"]]," 指提交所需的 DOM 变化。首次挂载也会开始这条流程；父组件更新、组件使用的 context 变化等，也可能让组件重新计算。"],"\n",["P",{},"假设父组件更新了计数，但子组件仍返回同一段标题。子组件可能被再次调用，标题 DOM 却不必修改。渲染次数不是 DOM 修改次数，更不能直接当作浏览器绘制次数。"],"\n",["P",{},"React 可以比较新旧描述，决定保留哪个节点、修改哪些属性。这个匹配过程通常称为 reconciliation。初学时不必背内部算法，先抓住结果：重新运行组件不意味着先清空整页再画一遍，输入框和组件状态可以在正确身份下被保留。"],"\n",["P",{},"DOM 尺寸依赖实际提交后的节点，不能在 render 中假定新的布局已经存在。布局 Effect 与普通 Effect 有不同调度时机，普通 Effect 也不能简单理解为“永远在绘制之后”。这一篇只建立阶段边界，完整外部同步留给后续 Effect 资料。"],"\n",["P",{},"与 ",["A",{"href":"/knowledge/materials/js-04-async-promise-browser-event-loop.md/js-04#%E5%BE%AE%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%AE%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%AD%89%E4%BA%8E%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%98%E5%88%B6"},"JS-04 的浏览器绘制时机",["SPAN",{"class":"material-reading-badge","data-state":"unread"},"未读"]],"对照，就能明白：框架完成一项工作，与用户看到像素更新，中间还隔着浏览器自己的安排。"],"\n",["H3",{"id":"三次加一先看它们实际提交了什么"},"三次加一先看它们实际提交了什么"],"\n",["P",{},"运行这个组件，先点“按当前值加三次”，再重置，再点“依次加三次”："],"\n",["DIV",{"class":"code-block","data-language":"tsx"},["DIV",{"class":"code-block__bar"},["SPAN",{},"tsx"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"code-copy"},"复制代码"]],["PRE",{"class":"hljs"},["CODE",{},["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"import"]," { useState } ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"from"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-string"},"'react'"],";\n\n",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"export"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"default"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"function"]," ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title function_"},"App"],"(",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-params"}],") {\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-keyword"},"const"]," [count, setCount] = ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-title function_"},"useState"],"(",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-number"},"0"],");\n  ",["SPAN",{"class":"hljs-k